Example data (example_synthetic.npz) — Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
(CC-BY-4.0).

These are 50 synthetic, PCA-sampled ATAA loading-state rows and their CSM reference fields; they
contain no patient data and do not represent 50 independent geometries or simulation runs. You are
free to share and adapt them with attribution to the accompanying paper.
